stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Selecting : user clicks / keyboard Enter·Space
  Selecting --> Validating : file chosen
  Validating --> Error : size > 2MB or wrong type
  Validating --> Uploading : valid file
  Error --> Idle : user dismisses
  Uploading --> Preview : upload success\nonUpload(url) called
  Uploading --> Error : upload failed
  Preview --> Selecting : user clicks change
  Preview --> Removed : user clicks remove
  Removed --> Idle
